Revision history for Map::Tube::Nuremberg

0.09    2026-11-16
        * fixed issue #9: removed taint mode (-T) from t/map.t, which made
          the test fail with Map::Tube 4.09 ("Malformed Map Data") and on
          Perl 5.14 to 5.20 ("Insecure dependency in eval")
        * declared test dependencies (Test::More, Test::Map::Tube)
        * minimum Perl version is now 5.14, as required by Map::Tube
        * replaced Travis CI with GitHub Actions

0.08    2024-12-02
        * added missing station for U3: Großreuth bei Schweinau
        * Friedrich-Ebert-Platz abbreviation replaced by full name
        * added more tests

0.07    2024-12-01
        * added missing link Rathenauplatz to Maxfeld (issue #7)
        * upgraded dependency on Map::Tube to 3.62

0.06    2018-05-01
        * fixed issue #2 (Map::Tube::Plugin::Formatter missing as Dependency)
